  "goodToKnow": "Die Stärkung has two sides: strengthening (die Stärkung des Euro) and, in everyday life, a little refreshment, such as a snack or drink on a long hike: Wir gönnen uns eine kleine Stärkung. Hikers' huts (Hütten) in the Alps offer exactly that. The verb is stärken, and the reflexive sich stärken means to fortify yourself, usually with something to eat. Stark means strong, which links them."
